{
 "section_summary": "This section contains translations of intercepted Japanese commercial messages, enclosed with three U.S. Embassy despatches from Chungking, plus a State Department routing note and the end of an earlier enclosure. The messages concern trade quotas, prices, shipping, warehouses, insurance, industrial equipment, raw materials, and payments across Japan, French Indochina, China, and Southeast Asia. The final enclosure continues beyond page 331.",
